sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App / browser
    participant Stub as Stub resolver (OS cache)
    participant Rec as Recursive resolver
    participant Root as Root server
    participant TLD as .com TLD server
    participant Auth as Authoritative NS
    App->>Stub: api.example.com?
    Stub->>Rec: cache miss, ask resolver
    Rec->>Root: api.example.com?
    Root-->>Rec: NS for .com
    Rec->>TLD: api.example.com?
    TLD-->>Rec: NS for example.com
    Rec->>Auth: api.example.com?
    Auth-->>Rec: A 203.0.113.10, TTL 300
    Rec-->>Stub: A 203.0.113.10 (cached for TTL)
    Stub-->>App: 203.0.113.10
